{
 "notation": "Handling of HTTP 429 from the MHub server, matching the web client (frontend/src/apis/music.js request/retryAfterMs and the player's prefetch retry in jizizr/mhub). retry_after: the Retry-After header (seconds or HTTP date, null when missing) read at now_ms. waits: the client sends one request per response in order, waiting out each 429 while the total wait stays within max_wait_ms; expect.waits lists the waits in ms; outcome is ok, rate_limited (with retry_after_ms and the error message) or http (the status of a non-429 error). seconds: whole seconds shown to the listener (rounded up). prefetch_delay: ms before retrying a prefetch after attempt failures, never sooner than the server's Retry-After.",
